{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42295","headline":"和印先辈及第後献座主朱舍人郊居之作 · 徐铉","name":"和印先辈及第後献座主朱舍人郊居之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成名郊外掩柴扉，树影蝉声共息机。\n积雨暗封青藓径，好风轻透白{糹朿}衣。\n嘉鱼始赋人争诵，荆玉频收国自肥。\n独坐公厅正烦暑，喜吟新咏见玄微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}